 & = \\\\ \\frac{(x-1)}{(x+1)}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, the expression simplifies to $\\frac{x-1}{x+1}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-9063d8ee-9fe6-5e2b-88bd-23fe4635e865"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-9063d8ee-9fe6-5e2b-88bd-23fe4635e865" :answer-field/id #uuid "9063d8ee-9fe6-5e2b-88bd-23fe4635e865" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-065d2cc6-2b7a-5048-8381-f0d529cf916c" :answer-field/choices ["answer-630c5016-91ed-523f-b3a0-229839ac925d" "answer-b342417f-d18f-57d0-bb5d-9490f37f2f1e" "answer-89dff5ec-8950-5602-9e19-37aace0522e5" "answer-065d2cc6-2b7a-5048-8381-f0d529cf916c" "answer-b4c5a728-8678-55ce-b083-4259d62dcb90"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-630c5016-91ed-523f-b3a0-229839ac925d" :answer/id #uuid "630c5016-91ed-523f-b3a0-229839ac925d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b342417f-d18f-57d0-bb5d-9490f37f2f1e" :answer/id #uuid "b342417f-d18f-57d0-bb5d-9490f37f2f1e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-89dff5ec-8950-5602-9e19-37aace0522e5" :answer/id #uuid "89dff5ec-8950-5602-9e19-37aace0522e5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2(x-1)}{(x+1)}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-065d2cc6-2b7a-5048-8381-f0d529cf916c" :answer/id #uuid "065d2cc6-2b7a-5048-8381-f0d529cf916c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{x-1}{x+1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b4c5a728-8678-55ce-b083-4259d62dcb90" :answer/id #uuid "b4c5a728-8678-55ce-b083-4259d62dcb90" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-85ebb17c-ed44-5cf2-a5c7-233470157f33" :question/id #uuid "85ebb17c-ed44-5cf2-a5c7-233470157f33" :question/math-academy-id "q-75369" :question/problem "$\\frac{12(x-1)}{15x}=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we decompose all of the terms into their various factors. The $12(x-1)$ in the numerator becomes $2\\cdot 2\\cdot 3\\cdot (x-1),$ and the $15x$ in the denominator becomes $3\\cdot 5\\cdot x.$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{12(x-1)}{15x}=\\frac{2\\cdot 2\\cdot 3\\cdot (x-1)}{3\\cdot 5\\cdot x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we cancel out all the pairs of common factors in the numerator and denominator. In this case, there is one pair of $3$'s.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2\\cdot 2\\cdot 3\\cdot (x-1)}{3\\cdot 5\\cdot x} & = \\\\ \\frac{2\\cdot 2\\cdot \\cancel{3}\\cdot (x-1)}{\\cancel{3}\\cdot 5\\cdot x} & = \\\\ \\frac{2\\cdot 2\\cdot (x-1)}{5\\cdot x} & = \\\\ \\frac{4(x-1)}{5x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, the expression simplifies to $\\frac{4(x-1)}{5x}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-e2e828d3-cf66-52fd-bbb8-8a49e2cdb0b3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e2e828d3-cf66-52fd-bbb8-8a49e2cdb0b3" :answer-field/id #uuid "e2e828d3-cf66-52fd-bbb8-8a49e2cdb0b3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-e670a8e1-db7a-57a0-a060-c21171cecfbd" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ef34483e-106e-5818-a18b-e61e50d39479" "answer-081c1c0a-d0e8-54bb-88e9-73fe216a5ecb" "answer-e670a8e1-db7a-57a0-a060-c21171cecfbd" "answer-f0cc50e3-0b5b-5c1a-862e-bef50e0df483" "answer-28b2884a-06e6-568f-b579-7f8512014993"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ef34483e-106e-5818-a18b-e61e50d39479" :answer/id #uuid "ef34483e-106e-5818-a18b-e61e50d39479" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2(x-1)}{3x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-081c1c0a-d0e8-54bb-88e9-73fe216a5ecb" :answer/id #uuid "081c1c0a-d0e8-54bb-88e9-73fe216a5ecb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2(x-1)}{5x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e670a8e1-db7a-57a0-a060-c21171cecfbd" 